{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Expansion</i>\u00a0VR reimagines real-time strategy for VR. Matches are short, intense, and built for competitive replayability. Every duel is a tactical showdown where quick decisions and smart strategy decide who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and refine your custom deck of units \u2014 from agile swarmers to devastating siege beasts \u2014 and deploy them with motion-based control. Outsmart rivals, time your moves, and tear down the enemy\u2019s Command Tower before they destroy yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Strategy</strong> \u2014 unlock units and abilities\u00a0 to create unique decks and tactics.<br><strong>Fast-Paced Duels</strong> \u2014 short matches packed with intensity, perfect for both quick sessions and extended play.<br><strong>Hands-On Control</strong> \u2014 immersive VR mechanics let you summon and command units with your hands.<br><strong>Diverse Sci-Fi Arenas</strong> \u2014 battle across unique maps with distinct layouts and challenges.<br><strong>Solo &amp; Multiplayer Modes</strong> \u2014 test your skills against AI or face off with real players worldwide.<br><strong>Active Development Roadmap</strong> \u2014 Expansion is in Early Access, with regular updates adding new maps, units, and features based on community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expansion blends the tactical depth of RTS with the thrill of Action Strategy, brought to life in a sci-fi world where victory is in your hands.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far reaches of space, a ruthless battle for resources is underway. Your Company, once focused solely on profitable mining, now faces unwelcome competition. To secure your claims and protect your bottom line, you must rally veteran miners, repurpose heavy equipment, and recruit unlikely allies \u2014 from privateers to alien forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your Company to victory, seize control of resource-rich asteroids, and expand your dominance ever outward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >These are your claims. This is your mining empire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/f3ddbe821621a2c9426555b7d0b864cf939e8488.jpg"},{"name":"Recruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/38b618f018373b12bbd92ad3e903d3fe5a7c4cb9.jpg"},{"name":"Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/419192cb733eb55b27713f691ef6e0713e85ce95.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/d98eb5e21dbd55c00acc8745642296bc9887151d.jpg"},{"name":"Real Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/c79fb191024f9a5a613f7b277891124d9e8ea9c4.jpg"},{"name":"Get ready to rumble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/3f19c9f65b8d20b2d4a6a5f050eb705a63b80af0.jpg"},{"name":"Get over here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/605e0f1b0bc1df4510f9af8936a8672d1765a8f1.jpg"},{"name":"Dominator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/d4fc307dea0f7386d840815fdcedbf4a161a3c21.jpg"},{"name":"Life lesson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/f1bf052cd16726a3963f5c407cf9be9d6a61dbfa.jpg"},{"name":"Go shopping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2669520/de798b77465cbf8bc7c48e243237eba4c2163015.jpg"}],"total":66},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2669520?t=1760985701","backg