ltiplayer Modes</strong> \u2014 test your skills against AI or face off with real players worldwide.<br><strong>Active Development Roadmap</strong> \u2014 Expansion is in Early Access, with regular updates adding new maps, units, and features based on community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expansion blends the tactical depth of RTS with the thrill of Action Strategy, brought to life in a sci-fi world where victory is in your hands.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far reaches of space, a ruthless battle for resources is underway. Your Company, once focused solely on profitable mining, now faces unwelcome competition. To secure your claims and protect your bottom line, you must rally veteran miners, repurpose heavy equipment, and recruit unlikely allies \u2014 from privateers to alien forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your Company to victory, seize control of resource-rich asteroids, and expand your dominance ever outward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >These are your claims. This is your mining empire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Plazma Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/d667f9fed3ad80f24aa8584ca642c01599b47975/header.jpg?t=1760985701","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669520/929817434/a18e8611f7c8d0ce689df696e9b34c868d17e18d/1760984856/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760985699","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669520/929817434/a18e8611f7c8d0ce689df696e9b34c868d17e18d/1760984856/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760985699","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669520/929817434/a18e8611f7c8